stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Active: canonical principal + ProjectAccess + usable credential
    Active --> Expired: connection or credential expiry reached
    Active --> Revoked: explicit revocation or canonical denial
    Expired --> Revoked: terminal denial
    Revoked --> [*]

    state Active {
        [*] --> CredentialActive
        CredentialActive --> CredentialRotating: rotation requested
        CredentialRotating --> CredentialActive: replacement verified
        CredentialRotating --> CredentialRevoked: rotation failed
        CredentialRevoked --> [*]
    }

    note right of Active
      ConnectionContract is metadata only.
      authorize_read requires canonical ProjectAccess.
      No local scope record can create authority.
    end note
